OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for UK's largest loo roll
OL,4,Afactory unravel
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers at a site earmarked for the
OL,7,Fconstruction of the UK's largest tissue
OL,8,Fpaper mill say they are "disappointed"
OL,9,Fafter the Finnish toilet roll
OL,10,Fmanufacturer behind the proposal pulled
OL,11,Fout.
OL,13,FPlanning permission for the Metsa
OL,14,Fdevelopment on a 211-acre site in Goole
OL,15,Fwas granted in September 2025.
OL,17,FAt the time, Metsa said the facility,
OL,18,Fwhich would cover about three million
OL,19,Fsq ft (279,000 sq m) and support up to
OL,20,F400 direct jobs.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
